# CCM Worker-launched command environment (local to each machine).
# Copy to config/child.env; the real file is Git-ignored.
# Supported variable: CURL_CA_BUNDLE (absolute path to an existing CA bundle).
# New pipe/PTY commands read this file when spawned; no Worker restart is needed.
# CURL_CA_BUNDLE=C:/path/to/curl-ca-bundle.crt
